  "Thank you for playing Railway Fury.": "Terima kasih telah memainkan Railway Fury.",
  "The original Railway Fury. Shoot straight ahead and steer through the row.": "Railway Fury asli. Tembak lurus ke depan dan arahkan melewati barisan.",
  "This older campaign has no complete starting time; timed leaderboards require a new save.": "Kampanye lama ini tidak memiliki waktu mulai yang lengkap; papan peringkat berjangka waktu memerlukan penyimpanan baru.",
  "UPGRADE_HIDE_RANKS": "UPGRADE_HIDE_RANKS",
  "You defeated the first railway boss! Thanks for playing Railway Fury.\n\nThe full game continues across three more levels with new scenery, stronger enemies, fire-control upgrades and two endings.\n\nReplay Level 1 or return to Upgrades.": "Anda mengalahkan bos kereta api pertama! Terima kasih telah memainkan Railway Fury.\n\nPermainan lengkap berlanjut di tiga level lagi dengan pemandangan baru, musuh yang lebih kuat, peningkatan pengendalian tembakan, dan dua akhir.\n\nPutar ulang Level 1 atau kembali ke Peningkatan.",
  "[b]RAILWAY FURY[/b]\n\n[b]Artwork[/b]\nClassic artwork: Hermurx\nModern characters and weapons: Synty Studios\n\n[b]Music[/b]\nPhat Phrog Studio — fantasy, medieval and Dark Abyss collections\nClassic soundtrack: Loyalty Freak Music and Komiku\n\n[b]Sound Effects[/b]\nGame Assets collection and Sonniss libraries\nConcrete footsteps: Levan Nadashvili / Sonniss GDC 2016\n\nThank you for playing Railway Fury.": "[b]RAILWAY FURY[/b]\n\n[b]Karya Seni[/b]\nKarya seni klasik: Hermurx\nKarakter dan senjata modern: Synty Studios\n\n[b]Musik[/b]\nPhat Phrog Studio — koleksi fantasi, abad pertengahan, dan Dark Abyss\nSoundtrack klasik: Loyalty Freak Music dan Komiku\n\n[b]Efek Suara[/b]\nKoleksi Aset Game dan perpustakaan Sonniss\nLangkah nyata: Levan Nadashvili / Sonniss GDC 2016\n\nTerima kasih telah memainkan Railway Fury.",
